すよ。\nただ3束以上だと水深が足りないと思います。","ts":"1626349335.361500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U76GA7MFA"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lz1S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e61e1677-7f92-4924-acea-e8db458e0632","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"素麺にもパスタレンチン容器みたいなのができるといいのにね(くっつく)","ts":"1626348836.359700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"30Lp5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8ac8dfa-8188-44e6-a2dc-79baeff452aa","type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"お湯はたっぷりじゃないとと思ってました。こっちも気になってます。 \u003chttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UdPq8kfqRtI\u003e","ts":"1626348835.359500","attachments":[{"fallback":"YouTube Video: 【基本】そうめんの茹で方（くっつかない・固まらぬ）絶品めんつゆの作り方","id":1,"author_name":"【田舎そば川原】料理・漬物","author_link":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCDzOfd9304g0cWmSameJNWw","title":"【基本】そうめんの茹で方（くっつかない・固まらぬ）絶品めんつゆの作り方","title_link":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UdPq8kfqRtI","thumb_url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/UdPq8kfqRtI/hqdefault.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"YouTube","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/youtube.png","thumb_width":480,"thumb_height":360,"video_html":"\u003ciframe width=\"400\" height=\"225\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UdPq8kfqRtI?feature=oembed\u0026autoplay=1\u0026iv_load_policy=3\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen\u003e\u003c/iframe\u003e","video_html_width":400,"video_html_height":225,"from_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UdPq8kfqRtI","original_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UdPq8kfqRtI"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ic1S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F3E840B3-38F5-4C64-896B-A5D4924BE633","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"お湯沸かすとこから5分で食べられるのでよい。","ts":"1626348807.358600","t